# Trim multi_v7_defconfig down to what this board can use: build only the
# STM32 platform (other SoCs' drivers and DTBs go with their ARCH_ option)
# and leave out buses the STM32MP135 doesn't have. Delete a line here to
# bring something back.

# --- other SoC platforms
# CONFIG_ARCH_VIRT is not set
